notes.body:
@j.novak this would be the general idea. One issue here is though, how the RTP dialogs are integrated into MainWindow. I apologize that I was not here for the original implementation and review, but the current integration is not a good one and actually problematic. Main issue here is, the strong dependency between the Dialog and MainWindow, making any changes on both sides a major pain.

Dialogs should be AS standalone as possible. Especially the mutex and singleton implementation in MainWindow is something I especially fought hard to get rid of in the past. 

Besides that, this patch CANNOT be merged as of right now, as - due to the tight integration between MainWindow and the dialogs, as well as the .ui files for the dialog and required sub-entries, currently during execution we get ::connect errors.

